{"id":"n15823-1-6","stage":3,"title":"박다 · 钉","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n15823-1-6-1","ko":"어쩌지. 구두 굽이 빠져 버렸어.","zh":"怎么办啊。鞋跟掉下来了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"어쩌지.","meaning":"“어찌하다(怎么会)”的缩略语。","explanation":"어쩌다：“어찌하다(怎么会)”的缩略语；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"어쩌다","audio":"/audio/85a8c2b5d5fccc03afbb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91975","senseId":"1","lemma":"어쩌다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어쩌지","audio":"/audio/e458e74417e5e016790e.mp3"}},{"text":"구두","meaning":"皮鞋","explanation":"구두：皮鞋。","readings":[{"term":"구두","audio":"/audio/0053d9a2905615031142.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26805","senseId":"1","lemma":"구두","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"구두","audio":"/audio/0053d9a2905615031142.mp3"}},{"text":"굽이","meaning":"鞋跟","explanation":"굽：鞋跟；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"굽","audio":"/audio/8fcba4c6011cc9271389.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36203","senseId":"2","lemma":"굽","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"굽이","audio":"/audio/94304b1a52a6dd03992b.mp3"}},{"text":"빠져","meaning":"漏，破","explanation":"빠지다：漏，破；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"빠지다","audio":"/audio/f1cb0821aeeaddd3adf4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66637","senseId":"9","lemma":"빠지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"빠져","audio":"/audio/d42cb74e4302d9997f32.mp3"}},{"text":"버렸어.","meaning":"做完、彻底结束（-아/어 버리다，可带遗憾或痛快语气）","explanation":"버리다：做完、彻底结束（-아/어 버리다，可带遗憾或痛快语气）；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"버리다","audio":"/audio/51654377be6bf0a0810e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62601","senseId":"1","lemma":"버리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"버렸어","audio":"/audio/fe1d7a5ead4341d8e790.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"85a8c2b5d5fccc03","term":"어쩌다","zh":"“어찌하다(怎么会)”的缩略语。","audio":"/audio/85a8c2b5d5fccc03afbb.mp3","ent